Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_pipe.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val f = |x| x + 1;
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name @= value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name @= value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0033]: Jet doesn't use `|` pipes for lambdas
  --> tests/ui/foreign_pipe.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     val f = |x| x + 1;
    |             ^
 Why: a short function is written with parentheses and `=>`
 Fix: write `(x) => x + 1` instead of `|x| x + 1`
